<view class="page"><view class="card"><text class="section-title">营业统计</text><view class="grid"><picker mode="date" value="{{start}}" data-key="start" bindchange="date"><view class="picker">起日 {{start || '不限'}}</view></picker><picker mode="date" value="{{end}}" data-key="end" bindchange="date"><view class="picker">止日 {{end}}</view></picker></view><button bindtap="refresh" loading="{{busy}}">查询</button></view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="notice">按归档日期统计，仅包含已结、已复核、非重复账单。当前有效样本 {{count}} 条，不代表完整营业数据。以下金额均为元。</view><view class="card"><text class="section-title">每日实收趋势</text><view class="line" wx:for="{{trend}}" wx:key="date"><view class="row"><text>{{item.date}}</text><text>¥{{item.money}}</text></view><view class="bar-track"><view class="bar" style="width:{{item.width}}%"></view></view><view class="muted">上传 {{item.uploaded}} · 识别完成 {{item.completed}} · 已复核 {{item.reviewed}} · 有效已结 {{item.settled}}</view></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!trend.length}}">此日期范围暂无样本。</view></view><view class="card"><text class="section-title">房间消费</text><view class="line" wx:for="{{rooms}}" wx:key="room"><view class="row"><text>{{item.room || '未记录房间'}}</text><text>¥{{item.money}}</text></view><view class="bar-track"><view class="bar" style="width:{{item.width}}%"></view></view><text class="muted">{{item.count}} 单 · 均单 ¥{{item.average}} · {{item.duration_minutes}} 分钟</text></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!rooms.length}}">暂无有效账单。</view></view><view class="card"><text class="section-title">支付方式分布</text><view class="line" wx:for="{{payments}}" wx:key="name"><view class="row"><text>{{item.name}} · {{item.count}} 单</text><text>¥{{item.money}}</text></view><view class="bar-track"><view class="bar" style="width:{{item.width}}%"></view></view></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!payments.length}}">暂无支付方式数据。</view></view><view class="card"><text class="section-title">包厢类型分布</text><view class="line" wx:for="{{types}}" wx:key="name"><view class="row"><text>{{item.name}} · {{item.count}} 单</text><text>¥{{item.money}}</text></view><view class="bar-track"><view class="bar" style="width:{{item.width}}%"></view></view></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!types.length}}">暂无包厢类型数据。</view></view></view>
